<title>USA: Jaclyn reaches settlement on handbag suits.</title>
<headline>Jaclyn reaches settlement on handbag suits.</headline>
<dateline>WEST NEW YORK, N.J. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jaclyn Inc on Thursday it settled two lawsuits relating to the manufacture and sale of a limited number of handbag styles by one of its divisions.</p>
<p>&quot;The settlement calls for a payment by the company of $487,500 and will be reflected in its quarter ended June 30, 1997, along with related legal costs,&quot; said Robert Chestnov, the company's chief executive.</p>
